		(descr "9-pin D-Sub connector, horizontal/angled (90 deg), THT-mount, pins (male), pitch 2.77x2.84mm, pin-PCB-offset 7.7mm, distance of mounting holes 25mm, distance of mounting holes to PCB edge 9.12mm. .318in/8.08mm footprint family (Kycon K22X-E9P-N class): the two 3.2mm boardlock holes sit MIDWAY BETWEEN THE PIN ROWS, 1.42mm behind the near row - that hole position, not the backset alone, is what tells this family apart from the 5.34mm PDI-09S-5 land this replaces. Pin drills opened to 1.1mm for the 1.09mm Kycon pin. VERIFY AGAINST A PHYSICAL SAMPLE BEFORE FAB. Drawing https://www.kycon.com/Pub_Eng_Draw/K22X-E9P-N.pdf ; superseded PDI land, for provenance: http://service.powerdynamics.com/ec/Catalog17/Section%2007.pdf")
